 "html": "<div class=\"border border-black\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-uppercase fs-5 text-center\">Surgery Unit - I</h3>\n    <div class=\"text-center fs-5 fw-semibold\">\n      Rajindra Hospital/ Govt. Medical College Patiala Prof& Head- Dr. Ashwani\n      Kumar\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"border border-black d-flex fw-bold\">\n      <div class=\"border-end border-black px-2 flex-grow-1 text-center\">\n        Surgery Ward No. 2\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"border-end border-black px-2 flex-grow-1 text-center\">\n        Surgery OPD No. 8\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"px-2 flex-grow-1 text-center\">\n        OPD Days : Mon/Thu OT Days : Tue/Fri\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"d-flex fw-bold\">\n      <div class=\"border-end border-black px-2 flex-grow-1 text-center\">\n        Assoc. Prof. \u2013 Dr Jaswinder Singh / Dr. Dinesh Kumar Pasi\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"px-2 flex-grow-1 text-center\">\n        S.R: Dr. Tejinderpal Singh /Dr. Parth Dhamija\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-center fs-4 fw-semibold\">Discharge Summary</h1>\n    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-end mt-2\">ABSSBY \u2013 NO</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-black d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2\">\n    <div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">Name</div>\n        <div>Shivani</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">Age</div>\n        <div>22 years</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">Sex</div>\n        <div>Female</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">CR No.</div>\n        <div>10035</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">DOA</div>\n        <div>02/01/2025</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">DOO</div>\n        <div>02/01/2025</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between patient-detail-column\">\n        <div class=\"fw-bold\">DOD</div>\n        <div>06/01/2025</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"container-fluid mx-0 px-0 w-full border border-black mt-4\">\n    <div class=\"row g-0 border-bottom border-black\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 h-full border-end border-black d-flex align-items-center px-1 fw-bold\">\n        Diagnosis\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-10 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center px-1\">\n        Chronic Calculus Cholecystitis\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row g-0 border-bottom border-black\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 border-end border-black d-flex align-items-center px-1 fw-bold\">\n        Op. Procedure\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-10 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center px-1\">\n        Laparoscopic Cholecystectomy under GA\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row g-0 border-bottom border-black\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 border-end border-black d-flex align-items-center px-1 fw-bold\">\n        Intra Op findings\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-10 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center px-1\">\n        Distended GB, calot\u2019s triangle identified, critical view of safety\n        visualized. cystic artery and duct identified and clipped. Skin closed\n        with Nylon 2-0 CN .\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row g-0 border-bottom border-black\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 border-end border-black d-flex align-items-center px-1 fw-bold\">\n        Presenting Complaints\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-10 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center px-1\">\n        c/o pain in upper abdomen for last 1.5 years Local Examination P/A\n        Soft, non tender, Non Distended, BS +\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row g-0 min-h-4\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 border-end border-black d-flex align-items-center px-1 fw-bold\">\n        Local Examination\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-10 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center px-1\">\n        P/A Soft, non tender, Non Distended, BS +\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"w-ful border border-black mt-4\">\n    <div class=\"container-fluid mx-0 py-2\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-3 d-flex justify-content-between\">\n          <div class=\"fw-bold\">Hb</div>\n          <div>13.0</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-4 border border-black\">\n    <h3 class=\"fs-6 fw-bold py-1 px-2 border-bottom border-black mb-0\">\n      Radiological Investigations\n    </h3>\n\n    <div class=\"container-fluid mx-0 px-2\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-2 border-end border-black\">USG W/A (02/01/2025)</div>\n        <div class=\"col-10\">\n          GB-partially distended. Multiple echogenic foci giving DAS in lumen\n          of GB largest 8-10mm s/o Cholelithiasis. No pericholecystic fluid\n          seen. CBD is WNL at porta.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"container-fluid mt-4 px-0\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <h3 class=\"mb-0 fs-6 fw-bold col-2\">Summary</h3>\n      <div class=\"col-10\">\n        Patient came to SOPD 8 with c/o pain in upper abdomen for last 1.5\n        years. Patient was admitted, examined, investigated and diagnosed as a\n        case of Chronic Calculus Cholecystitis. Patient was taken up for\n        Laparoscopic Cholecystectomy under GA on 03/01/2025. Sample sent for\n        Histopathology. Patient was shifted to ward under satisfactory\n        condition. Patient was managed with appropriate analgesics,\n        antibiotics, IV fluids and ASD. Drain was removed on 06/01/2025. Now\n        patient has improved symptomatically, wound is healthy, accepting\n        orally, passing flatus & stools and is being discharged in\n        satisfactory condition with advice to follow up in S-OPD 8 with HPE\n        report on Monday/Thursday after 10 days for suture removal.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"container-fluid mt-4\">\n    <div class=\"row border border-black\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 border-end border-black fw-bold\">Advice</div>\n      <div class=\"col-10\">\n        <div>Tab Cefpodoxime BD for 7 days</div>\n        <div>Tab Pantoprazole 40mg OD x 7 days</div>\n        <div>Tab Diclofenac Para SP BD x 7 days</div>\n        <div>Tab Buscopan BD x 7 days</div>\n        <div>Tab Multivitamin OD x 7 days</div>\n        <div>Avoid fatty/ oily food, Milk and Milk products.</div>\n        <div>\n          Follow up in Surgery OPD room no 8 on Mon/Thu for suture removal\n          after 10 days with HPE report.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row border border-top-0 border-black\">\n      <div class=\"col-2 fw-bold border-end border-black\">Follow up</div>\n      <div class=\"col-10\">13/01/2025</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-end mt-4\">\n    <div>\n      <div>Dr. John Doe</div>\n      <div class=\"fw-bold\">Junior Resident</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
